@startuml cu16
!theme plain
title CU16 — Eliminar gestión

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) looks up a management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the list of available managements.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a management.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Shows the management data.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) confirms the deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the selected management.
System -> System : System

@enduml